<title>USA: Janex seeks financing, acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Janex seeks financing, acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Janex International Inc said Wednesday that it is seeking additional sources of financing, including possible acquisition or merger partners.</p>
<p>The California-based company issued the statement after reporting a 1996 fiscal year loss of $0.56 a share on sales that had fallen to $7.1 million.</p>
<p>It reported a 1995 full year loss of $0.23 per share on sales of $9.4 million.</p>
</text>
